            <div class="offering-body">

              <h2 id="concierge">RV Concierge Service</h2>

              <h4>Monthly check-ins for your stored RV</h4>

              <!-- Original wording
<p>Check for rodent invasion or damage, run the generator for a few minutes as is likely specified in your

                manual. run the heater for a few minutes as is likely specified in your manual. Do an overall visual

                checkout of your RV.


-->
              <p>While your RV is in storage or  perhaps unattended on a deer lease, I visit once a month to look for signs of rodents or visible damage and
                review its overall condition. I also check equipment operation and tire pressure, including performing any manufacturer's recommended monthly startups of your generator, air conditioner, and heater.</p>


                <p>I will send you an email after each visit with current overview photos and photos of any specific issues found.</p>
              <p>Each visit requires your approval in advance and access to your RV while you are
                away.</p>
              <!-- Original wording
<p>Texas Hill Country, San Antonio, and parts of South Texas are available for concierge service as well

                as the Austin area.</p>
-->
              <p>Service is available in the Austin area, the Texas Hill Country, San Antonio, and parts of South Texas.
                Contact me to confirm availability at your storage location.</p>

              <div class="offering-price"><span class="service-price-pair">
                  <s class="service-price-regular" data-regular-price="149" data-sale-target="service-sale-19"><span
                      class="sr-only">Regular price
                    </span><span data-regular-amount>$149</span></s>per monthly visit.
                  <br>
                  <span class="rv-sale-price">
                    <strong class="service-price-current" id="service-sale-19"><span class="sr-only">Sale price
                      </span><span data-sale-amount>$119</span></strong><span
                      class="grand-opening-mini">Grand<br>Opening</span></span></span> per month for 1st three visits.
                <!-- Original wording
per Monthly Visit (Client approves each month in

                advance; Unattended access to RV is required)
